### Traer todas las aulas
GET http://localhost:3000/classrooms

### ---

### Crear aula
POST http://localhost:3000/classrooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "laboraasdo",
  "duenio": "asdse"
}

### ---

### Obtener aula por codigo (join_code)
GET http://localhost:3000/classrooms/code/GL-2009

### ---

### Obtener aula por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/classrooms/2

### ---

### Eliminar aula por ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/classrooms/8